Package: tlosint-maigret
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3
Description: Collect a dossier on a person by username
 Maigret searches a large number of sites for a given username and
 assembles the results into a report, extracting whatever personal
 information each site exposes.
 .
 Ships a self-contained virtualenv under /opt/tracelabs/maigret so its
 dependency pins cannot collide with other OSINT tools on the system.
